#!args apps/JFNetworker/tests/fixtures/live_changes.jfnet --scenario apps/JFNetworker/tests/scen/live_changes.scn --golden apps/JFNetworker/tests/scen/live_changes.report
# golden scenario: what changes under load (load set, lb, kv set, svc set, cache clear): each step
# acts on running services, their counters go on and none restarts.  The GUI program runs
# tests/scen/live_changes.scn on tests/fixtures/live_changes.jfnet without a window and ends with the
# report, which must equal tests/scen/live_changes.report byte for byte on every target (the script
# itself is not run)
